---
import { copy, localizedPath, type SiteLocale } from "../lib/i18n";

interface Props { locale: SiteLocale; }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const c = (english: string, simplified: string) => copy(locale, english, simplified);
---

<article class="security-page">
  <section class="security-hero shell">
    <div class="hero-copy reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">{c("SECURITY, BY DESIGN", "安全，始于设计")}</p>
      <h1 class="display">
        {c("Security is not", "安全不是单一功能，")}<br />
        <em>{c("a single feature.", "而是贯穿始终。")}</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-summary">
        {c(
          "Termind protects the whole path to your server: software credentials are kept in Apple’s security system, sensitive memory is zeroized after use, server identity is verified before authentication, and Assistant and MCP access stays within boundaries you choose.",
          "Termind 保护通往服务器的整个过程：软件凭据存入 Apple 的安全系统，敏感内存在使用后及时清零，认证前核验服务器身份，AI 助手与 MCP 则只在你选择的边界内行动。"
        )}
      </p>
      <div class="hero-links">
        <a href="#ssh-keys">{c("Explore the security model", "了解安全设计")} <span>↓</span></a>
        <a href={localizedPath(locale, "/privacy/")}>{c("Read the Privacy Policy", "阅读隐私政策")} <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="key-stage reveal" style="animation-delay: 120ms" aria-label={c("A private key protected inside your device", "私钥受到设备保护")}>
      <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div>
      <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
      <div class="key-core">
        <div class="key-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="key-ring"></span><span class="key-stem"></span><span class="key-tooth one"></span><span class="key-tooth two"></span>
        </div>
        <strong>{c("PROTECTED", "全程保护")}</strong>
        <small>{c("Credentials · Connections · Actions", "凭据 · 连接 · 操作")}</small>
      </div>
      <span class="stage-label label-keychain">KEYCHAIN</span>
      <span class="stage-label label-host">KNOWN HOSTS</span>
      <span class="stage-label label-local">LOCAL FIRST</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="trust-strip" aria-label={c("Termind security principles", "Termind 安全原则")}>
    <div class="shell trust-grid">
      <div><span>01</span><strong>{c("Credentials are protected", "凭据全程受到保护")}</strong><p>{c("Secure at rest, short-lived and zeroized in memory.", "静态存储安全，进入内存后短暂使用并及时清零。")}</p></div>
      <div><span>02</span><strong>{c("Trust is verified", "连接前核验身份")}</strong><p>{c("A changed server key is surfaced, not silently accepted.", "服务器密钥发生变化时，不会静默接受。")}</p></div>
      <div><span>03</span><strong>{c("Access is your choice", "访问权由你决定")}</strong><p>{c("Assistant and MCP features are optional and configurable.", "AI 助手与 MCP 均可选、可配置。")}</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="keys shell" id="ssh-keys">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <p class="section-index">01 / SSH KEYS</p>
      <div>
        <h2 class="display">{c("A short path", "密钥在内存中，")}<br /><em>{c("through memory.", "只走最短的路。")}</em></h2>
        <p>{c(
          "A secret has to enter memory briefly for software-key authentication. Termind deliberately limits that window instead of letting plaintext linger in ordinary application values.",
          "使用软件密钥认证时，密钥不可避免地会短暂进入内存。Termind 会主动缩短这个窗口，而不是让明文长期停留在普通应用数据中。"
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="zeroize-story">
      <header class="zeroize-lead">
        <p class="zeroize-kicker"><i></i>{c("SECRET MEMORY LIFECYCLE", "密钥内存生命周期")}</p>
        <h3>{c("A secret passes through.", "密钥短暂停留，")}<br /><em>{c("Its trace does not.", "痕迹不被留下。")}</em></h3>
        <p>{c(
          "Normal memory release does not guarantee that old bytes disappear immediately. Termind therefore gives SSH passwords, software private keys, and passphrases a dedicated one-shot lifetime. The source buffer is cleared after the secret is moved, and the owned allocation is overwritten before it is released.",
          "普通的内存释放并不保证原有字节立即消失。因此，Termind 为 SSH 密码、软件私钥和口令设置了专用的一次性生命周期：密钥转移后先清除来源缓冲区，使用完毕后再覆写其专用内存，最后才释放。"
        )}</p>
      </header>

      <ol class="memory-track" aria-label={c("Secret memory lifecycle", "密钥内存生命周期")}>
        <li>
          <div class="track-top"><span>01</span><i class="track-signal"></i></div>
          <div class="track-visual keychain-memory" aria-hidden="true"><b></b></div>
          <strong>{c("Read when needed", "按需读取")}</strong>
          <small>{c("Apple Keychain", "Apple 钥匙串")}</small>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="track-top"><span>02</span><i class="track-signal"></i></div>
          <div class="track-visual bytes-memory" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b></div>
          <strong>{c("Move once", "一次性转入")}</strong>
          <small>{c("Source cleared", "来源随即清除")}</small>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="track-top"><span>03</span><i class="track-signal"></i></div>
          <div class="track-visual auth-memory" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><i></i></div>
          <strong>{c("Authenticate", "完成认证")}</strong>
          <small>{c("One-shot use", "仅使用一次")}</small>
        </li>
        <li class="wiped">
          <div class="track-top"><span>00</span><i class="track-signal"></i></div>
          <div class="track-visual zero-memory" aria-hidden="true"><code>00 00<br />00 00</code></div>
          <strong>{c("Overwrite", "覆写归零")}</strong>
          <small>{c("Then release", "随后释放")}</small>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <footer class="zeroize-assurance">
        <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
        <div>
          <strong>{c("Cleanup is not a success-only path.", "清理不只发生在认证成功时。")}</strong>
          <p>{c(
            "The same zeroization runs when authentication fails or exits early. Consuming or clearing the shared one-shot backing also invalidates Termind’s other references to that secret.",
            "认证失败或提前退出时，同样会执行内存清零；一份一次性内存被消费或清除后，Termind 中指向该密钥的其他引用也会随之失效。"
          )}</p>
        </div>
        <code>SUCCESS · FAILURE · CANCEL</code>
      </footer>
    </div>

    <div class="storage-intro">
      <p class="mini-label">{c("AT REST", "静态存储")}</p>
      <h3>{c("Protected before it enters memory.", "进入内存前，也受到妥善保护。")}</h3>
      <p>{c(
        "Termind keeps host details and software credentials in separate places. Passwords and software private keys live in Apple’s Data Protection Keychain, while the Vault stores the information needed to identify and organize them. You can choose whether to save a software key’s passphrase with that key; otherwise, enter it when connecting.",
        "Termind 将主机资料与软件凭据分开保存。密码和软件私钥存入 Apple 数据保护钥匙串；保管库保存用于识别和整理凭据的信息。你可以选择是否将软件密钥的口令与该密钥一同保存；不保存时，连接时再输入。"
      )}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="storage-grid">
      <article>
        <span class="storage-number">A</span>
        <div class="storage-icon device-icon" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>{c("This Device", "这台设备")}</h3>
        <p>{c("Keep a password or software SSH key on the current device only. It does not sync to your other devices.", "把密码或软件 SSH 私钥仅保留在当前设备，不同步到其他设备。")}</p>
        <span class="storage-tag">{c("DEVICE ONLY", "仅限本机")}</span>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span class="storage-number">B</span>
        <div class="storage-icon cloud-icon" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>{c("iCloud Keychain", "iCloud 钥匙串")}</h3>
        <p>{c("Let Apple’s iCloud Keychain make a password or software SSH key available across your approved devices.", "通过 Apple 的 iCloud 钥匙串，让密码或软件 SSH 私钥在你批准的设备间可用。")}</p>
        <span class="storage-tag">{c("YOUR APPLE DEVICES", "你的 APPLE 设备")}</span>
      </article>
      <article class="featured">
        <span class="storage-number">C</span>
        <div class="storage-icon enclave-icon" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>{c("Secure Enclave", "安全隔区")}</h3>
        <p>{c("Generate a hardware-protected P-256 key whose private half cannot be exported or synced. You can also require Touch ID or the device password when it is used.", "生成受硬件保护的 P-256 密钥；私钥部分不可导出，也不会同步。使用时还可要求 Touch ID 或设备密码验证。")}</p>
        <span class="storage-tag">{c("NON-EXPORTABLE", "不可导出")}</span>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span class="storage-number">D</span>
        <div class="storage-icon security-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="16" cy="22" r="8"></circle>
            <path d="M24 22h15v6h-5v-3h-4v3h-5"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>{c("Hardware Keys", "硬件密钥")}</h3>
        <p>{c("Use a compatible FIDO2 hardware key for ECDSA-SK P-256 SSH authentication. The private key stays on the hardware key.", "使用兼容的 FIDO2 硬件密钥进行 ECDSA-SK P-256 SSH 认证。私钥留在硬件密钥上。")}</p>
        <span class="storage-tag">{c("HARDWARE KEYS", "硬件密钥")}</span>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="connection-check">
      <div class="fingerprint-card" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>SHA256</span>
        <code>Q7:nD:4e:9A:••:K2</code>
        <i></i>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="mini-label">{c("BEFORE CREDENTIALS ARE USED", "使用凭据之前")}</p>
        <h3>{c("The server proves its identity first.", "先确认服务器，再发送凭据。")}</h3>
        <p>{c(
          "Known Hosts records the server’s public-key fingerprint. On a first connection, Termind asks you to review it. If the key later changes, Termind stops and shows the mismatch so you can investigate instead of quietly continuing.",
          "“已知主机”会记录服务器公钥指纹。首次连接时，Termind 会请你确认；如果密钥之后发生变化，Termind 会停止连接并提示不匹配，让你先查明原因，而不是静默继续。"
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="intelligence-wrap">
    <div class="shell intelligence">
      <header>
        <p class="section-index">{c("02 / ASSISTANT", "02 / AI 助手")}</p>
        <h2 class="display">{c("Useful access.", "有用的访问权，")}<br /><em>{c("Visible boundaries.", "清晰的边界。")}</em></h2>
      </header>
      <div class="agent-copy">
        <p>{c(
          "The AI Assistant is optional and uses the model provider you configure. SSH authentication happens locally: private-key material is not placed into the conversation or sent to the model as chat context.",
          "AI 助手是可选功能，并使用你配置的模型提供方。SSH 认证在本地完成：私钥材料不会写入对话，也不会作为聊天上下文发送给模型。"
        )}</p>
        <p>{c(
          "When the Assistant needs to run a command or work with a file, Termind applies the tool policy and approval mode you selected. You can review actions yourself, use a security-review model, or grant broader access when the environment calls for it.",
          "当助手需要执行命令或处理文件时，Termind 会执行你选择的工具策略与审批模式。你可以亲自确认操作、交给安全审查模型评估，也可以在合适的环境中授予更广泛的访问权。"
        )}</p>
        <div class="boundary-note">
          <strong>{c("Know what is shared", "了解哪些内容会被共享")}</strong>
          <p>{c(
            "Prompts, authorized command output, file contents, attachments, and relevant session context may be sent to your selected model provider. Its policies govern that data. Choose permissions and a provider appropriate for the server you are working on.",
            "提示词、你授权读取的命令输出或文件内容、附件及相关会话上下文，可能会发送给你选择的模型提供方，并受其政策约束。请根据所操作服务器的敏感程度选择合适的权限和提供方。"
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mcp shell">
    <header class="section-heading compact">
      <p class="section-index">{c("03 / BUILT-IN MCP SERVER", "03 / 内置 MCP 服务器")}</p>
      <div>
        <h2 class="display">{c("A local doorway.", "本机入口，")} <em>{c("Opened by you.", "由你开启。")}</em></h2>
        <p>{c(
          "On Mac, Termind’s built-in MCP server lets compatible local clients use the SSH and SFTP tools you choose to expose. It is off by default and listens only on this Mac’s loopback addresses.",
          "在 Mac 上，Termind 的内置 MCP 服务器允许兼容的本机客户端使用你选择开放的 SSH 与 SFTP 工具。它默认关闭，并且只监听这台 Mac 的本机回环地址。"
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="mcp-flow" aria-label={c("Built-in MCP security layers", "内置 MCP 的安全层") }>
      <div><span>1</span><strong>{c("Off by default", "默认关闭")}</strong><small>{c("Enable it when needed", "需要时再开启")}</small></div>
      <i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
      <div><span>2</span><strong>{c("Local only", "仅限本机")}</strong><small>127.0.0.1 / ::1</small></div>
      <i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
      <div><span>3</span><strong>{c("Bearer Token", "Bearer Token")}</strong><small>{c("Stored on this Mac", "仅保存在这台 Mac")}</small></div>
      <i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
      <div><span>4</span><strong>{c("Tool switches", "工具开关")}</strong><small>{c("Expose only what you need", "只开放需要的能力")}</small></div>
    </div>
    <p class="mcp-caution">{c(
      "An authenticated MCP client can invoke the tools you expose without a confirmation prompt for every call. Give the Bearer Token only to clients you trust, expose the minimum tools they need, and turn the server off when it is not in use.",
      "通过认证的 MCP 客户端可以直接调用你开放的工具，不会在每次调用时单独请求确认。请只把 Bearer Token 交给可信的客户端，仅开放所需工具，并在不使用时关闭服务器。"
    )}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="choices shell">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">{c("SECURITY IS A SHARED PRACTICE", "安全也需要你的参与")}</p>
      <h2 class="display">{c("A secure foundation,", "安全的基础，")}<br /><em>{c("with choices that stay yours.", "加上始终属于你的选择。")}</em></h2>
    </div>
    <ol>
      <li><span>01</span><p>{c("Prefer a Secure Enclave key when you do not need to move or export it—the private key never enters app memory.", "如果不需要迁移或导出密钥，优先使用安全隔区密钥；私钥本身不会进入应用内存。")}</p></li>
      <li><span>02</span><p>{c("Verify a new or changed host fingerprint through a trusted channel.", "通过可信渠道核对首次出现或发生变化的主机指纹。")}</p></li>
      <li><span>03</span><p>{c("Give the Assistant and built-in MCP server only the access needed for the task.", "只向 AI 助手和内置 MCP 服务器授予完成任务所需的权限。")}</p></li>
      <li><span>04</span><p>{c("Keep your Apple devices, accounts, and model-provider credentials protected.", "妥善保护 Apple 设备、账户及模型提供方凭据。")}</p></li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</article>

<style>
  .security-page { overflow: hidden; }
  .security-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr; align-items: center; min-height: 690px; gap: 5rem; padding-block: 5.5rem 6.5rem; }
  .hero-copy { max-width: 680px; }
  .hero-copy h1 { margin-top: 1.35rem; font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 7vw, 6.8rem); }
  .hero-copy h1 em { color: var(--cyan); }
  .hero-summary { max-width: 660px; margin: 2rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .hero-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem 2.4rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .hero-links a { color: var(--ink); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .03em; text-decoration: none; }
  .hero-links span { margin-left: .35rem; color: var(--cyan); }

  .key-stage { position: relative; display: grid; place-items: center; aspect-ratio: 1; isolation: isolate; }
  .key-stage::before { position: absolute; inset: 8%; border-radius: 50%; content: ""; background: var(--surface); filter: none; }
  .orbit { position: absolute; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 50%; }
  .orbit::after { position: absolute; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; content: ""; background: #93afc2; box-shadow: none; }
  .orbit-one { inset: 12%; animation: orbit-spin 18s linear infinite; }
  .orbit-one::after { top: 18%; right: 7%; }
  .orbit-two { inset: 25%; border-style: dashed; opacity: .65; animation: orbit-spin 26s linear infinite reverse; }
  .orbit-two::after { bottom: -4px; left: 48%; background: var(--green); }
  .key-core { position: relative; z-index: 2; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-direction: column; width: 44%; aspect-ratio: 1; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 23%; background: #fff; box-shadow: var(--shadow); transform: rotate(-5deg); }
  .key-core strong { margin-top: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .16em; }
  .key-core small { color: var(--faint); font-size: .66rem; }
  .key-mark { position: relative; width: 84px; height: 54px; transform: rotate(-36deg); }
  .key-ring { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 5px; width: 42px; height: 42px; border: 9px solid var(--cyan); border-radius: 50%; }
  .key-stem { position: absolute; left: 35px; top: 21px; width: 47px; height: 10px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--cyan); }
  .key-tooth { position: absolute; width: 9px; height: 18px; background: var(--cyan); }
  .key-tooth.one { right: 12px; top: 24px; }
  .key-tooth.two { right: 0; top: 24px; height: 14px; }
  .stage-label { position: absolute; padding: .4rem .65rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; color: var(--faint); background: rgba(255,255,255,.72); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .56rem; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .label-keychain { top: 14%; left: 3%; }
  .label-host { right: 0; bottom: 22%; }
  .label-local { bottom: 5%; left: 19%; }
  @keyframes orbit-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

  .trust-strip { border-block: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(255,255,255,.55); }
  .trust-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .trust-grid > div { padding: 2.2rem 2.4rem; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .trust-grid > div:last-child { border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .trust-grid span { color: var(--cyan); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .65rem; }
  .trust-grid strong { display: block; margin-top: .65rem; font-size: .96rem; }
  .trust-grid p { margin: .25rem 0 0; color: var(--faint); font-size: .78rem; }

  .keys { padding-block: 6rem 7rem; }
  .section-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(130px, .3fr) 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: start; }
  .section-heading > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .75fr; gap: 4.5rem; align-items: end; }
  .section-heading h2 { font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 5vw, 5rem); }
  .section-heading h2 em { color: var(--cyan); }
  .section-heading > div > p { margin: 0 0 .35rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .section-index, .mini-label { margin: .7rem 0 0; color: var(--cyan); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .66rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .13em; }
  .keys > .section-heading { grid-template-columns: 104px 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .keys > .section-heading > div { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .9fr) minmax(320px, .72fr); gap: 2.75rem; align-items: center; }
  .keys > .section-heading h2 { font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 4.15vw, 4.2rem); line-height: 1.02; }
  .keys > .section-heading > div > p { max-width: 520px; font-size: .92rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .storage-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 4.5rem; overflow-x: auto; }
  .zeroize-story { position: relative; margin-top: 2.6rem; padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--panel-radius); color: var(--ink); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: none; isolation: isolate; }
  .zeroize-story::before { display: none; }
  .zeroize-lead { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .78fr 1.22fr; column-gap: 3.5rem; align-items: end; }
  .zeroize-kicker { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; margin: 0 0 .9rem; color: var(--cyan); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .6rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .14em; }
  .zeroize-kicker i { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #58c8f9; box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(88,200,249,.9); }
  .zeroize-lead h3 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 3.7vw, 3.8rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.035em; line-height: 1.04; }
  .zeroize-lead h3 em { color: var(--cyan); font-style: italic; }
  .zeroize-lead > p:last-child { max-width: 610px; margin: 0 0 .2rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .memory-track { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); margin: 3rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
